{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/95361be0c30a3037b7e6b3acfe4a283d.avif?t=1753704686\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/4fc83e4fe1e561f1be5cd28c7468702c.poster.avif?t=1753704686\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/4fc83e4fe1e561f1be5cd28c7468702c.webm?t=1753704686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/4fc83e4fe1e561f1be5cd28c7468702c.mp4?t=1753704686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brandon</strong> and <strong>Miles</strong> have signed up for Dr. Ripley's new experiment\u2014<strong>the Changing Prisoner's Dilemma</strong>. During the experiment, it is rumored that some guys have transformed into well-endowed girls because of Ripley's new machine called the Biomass Redistribution Converter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brandon mistakenly thought they would be girls for just a couple of weeks at most. Little did they know it would be much longer than that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Brandon cheat the experiment, betraying his friend as a buxom blonde? Or will Brandon become <strong>Brandy</strong>, a busty brunette who will crave new hidden feelings for her once childhood friend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/ebd4e819b78c516f7d44625b3e04997d.poster.avif?t=1753704686\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/ebd4e819b78c516f7d44625b3e04997d.webm?t=1753704686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/ebd4e819b78c516f7d44625b3e04997d.mp4?t=1753704686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Changing Pirsoner's Dilemma, you will view everything as Brandon/Brandy. You can move/look around the various rooms of the college facility. Everything will be viewed in the POV perspective. You can change the experiment's outcome by finding hidden clues in the experiment as the timer runs out. You can unlock dialogue options and entirely new routes, including different positions ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/9ba9fe691e0219c0c568b9b5e9b747fb.poster.avif?t=1753704686\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/9ba9fe691e0219c0c568b9b5e9b747fb.webm?t=1753704686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408630/extras/9ba9fe691e0219c0c568b9b5e9b747fb.mp4?t=1753704686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted 2d animations\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed 3D environments</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple transformations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutscenes with dialogue options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is spoken with actual audio</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets to be found in the environmen